        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Canaropa JNF FP223-70-630, Modern Square Satin Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by JNF in Europe, the 2-3/4 Inch Square Stainless Steel Flush Pull features a modern design that is exemplified by strong, sharp lines. It comes in a satin stainless steel finish that is easy to maintain. This pocket door finger pull is a stunning example of the ultra modern decor movement.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-223-70-dimentions.gif?v=1704354578\" width=\"297\" height=\"155\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Canaropa JNF-223-70 Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Smaller <a href=\"/products/modern-2-inch-square-stainless-steel-flush-pull-canaropa-jnf-fp223-50-630\"><b> 2\" Square Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Square Stainless Steel Flush Pull is pressure mounted into the door so screws are not needed. For use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors--any door where a \"flush with the door face\" pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Modern Square Pocket Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2-3/4\" square (70 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 19/32\" (15 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 17-32\" (14 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 1-1/2\" square (40 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Diameter: 2-1/4\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 3/16\" (5 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
